model { extend basalt.deployment { metadata { constraint "Deployment backend acceptance counts direct and pooled runtime client backends per logical database only after desired runtime readiness. Unknown visibility is a failed observation; release-only signed readiness and boot revalidation precede the unchanged 90-second convergence window within a 270-second overall operation. The existing two-minute verifier wrapper reserves five seconds for retention and teardown; readiness keeps its 180-second startup budget." } } }
